INSERT  IGNORE INTO `question_content` (`id`, `question_id`, `stem`, `options`, `correct_answer`, `analysis`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (284,284,'The company was ___ in 2005 and has grown rapidly since then.','[]','established','公司于2005年（成立），此后迅速发展壮大。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(285,285,'She is very ___ about her chances of winning the scholarship.','[]','optimistic','她对自己获得奖学金的机会非常（乐观）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(286,286,'We need to ___ the problem before making a decision.','[]','analyze','在做决定之前我们需要先（分析）这个问题。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(287,287,'There is a growing ___ that climate change needs immediate action.','[]','awareness','人们越来越（意识到）气候变化需要立即采取行动。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(288,288,'He has a remarkable ___ for learning new languages.','[]','capacity','他学习新语言的（能力）非常出色。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(289,289,'The new policy will come into ___ next month.','[]','effect','新政策将于下个月（生效）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(290,290,'The city has made ___ progress in reducing pollution.','[]','significant','该市在减少污染方面取得了（显著的）进步。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(291,291,'The doctor ___ him to take the medicine three times a day.','[]','advised','医生（建议）他每天服药三次。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(292,292,'Her performance in the exam was beyond our ___.','[]','expectations','她在考试中的表现超出了我们的（预期）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(293,293,'These two words are similar in meaning but ___ in usage.','[]','differ','这两个词意思相近但用法（不同）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(294,294,'The government is taking measures to ___ unemployment.','[]','reduce','政府正在采取措施（减少）失业率。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(295,295,'I can hardly ___ the difference between these two pictures.','[]','distinguish','我几乎无法（分辨）这两张图片的区别。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(296,296,'The book provides a detailed ___ of modern Chinese history.','[]','account','这本书对中国现代史提供了详细的（描述）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(297,297,'He is one of the most ___ writers in contemporary literature.','[]','influential','他是当代文学中最有（影响力的）作家之一。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(298,298,'Many students find it difficult to ___ to college life.','[]','adapt','许多学生发现很难（适应）大学生活。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(299,299,'The research ___ that students who read more perform better.','[]','indicates','研究（表明）阅读量更大的学生表现更好。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(300,300,'We should take ___ of this opportunity to improve our skills.','[]','advantage','我们应该（利用）这个机会来提高我们的技能。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(301,301,'His ___ to the problem impressed all the experts.','[]','approach','他解决问题的（方法）给所有专家留下了深刻印象。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(302,302,'The company plans to ___ its business to overseas markets.','[]','expand','公司计划将业务（扩展到）海外市场。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(303,303,'A healthy diet is ___ to maintaining good health.','[]','essential','健康饮食对保持身体健康至关（重要）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(304,304,'The students showed great ___ in solving the math problem.','[]','enthusiasm','学生们在解决数学问题时表现出极大的（热情）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(305,305,'We cannot ___ the importance of a good education.','[]','ignore','我们不能（忽视）良好教育的重要性。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(306,306,'His success is largely ___ to his hard work and dedication.','[]','due','他的成功很大程度上（归功于）他的努力和奉献。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(307,307,'Reading can help to ___ your vocabulary significantly.','[]','enrich','阅读可以显著（丰富）你的词汇量。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(308,308,'The manager ___ the importance of team cooperation.','[]','emphasized','经理（强调了）团队合作的重要性。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(309,309,'The committee finally ___ a decision after three hours of discussion.','[]','reached','委员会经过三个小时的讨论终于（做出）了决定。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(310,310,'The evidence was ___ to prove his innocence beyond doubt.','[]','sufficient','证据（足以）毫无疑问地证明他的清白。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(311,311,'She decided to ___ English at a local university after graduation.','[]','study','她决定毕业后在当地大学（学习）英语。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(312,312,'We finally ___ our goal after three years of hard work.','[]','achieved','经过三年的努力，我们终于（实现）了目标。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(313,313,'A balanced diet is very ___ for children\'s growth.','[]','important','均衡饮食对儿童的成长非常（重要）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(314,314,'The researchers sought to ___ their findings to a broader population.','[]','generalize','研究人员试图将他们的发现（推广）到更广泛的人群。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(315,315,'It is estimated that the project will take six months to ___.','[]','complete','据估计，这个项目需要六个月才能（完成）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(316,316,'The government has pledged to ___ corruption within the public sector.','[]','eliminate','政府承诺（消除）公共部门的腐败现象。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(317,317,'The ___ of AI technology has transformed many industries.','[]','emergence','人工智能技术的（出现）已经改变了许多行业。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(318,318,'Many people tend to ___ their own achievements in the workplace.','[]','overestimate','许多人倾向于在工作中（高估）自己的成就。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(319,319,'Scientists are trying to ___ the mysteries of the human brain.','[]','uncover','科学家正在试图（揭开）人类大脑的奥秘。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(320,320,'___ economic growth requires both innovation and structural reforms.','[]','sustainable','（可持续的）经济增长需要创新和结构性改革。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(321,321,'The professor ___ the importance of critical thinking in education.','[]','emphasized','教授（强调了）批判性思维在教育中的重要性。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(322,322,'The medication may have some side effects, but they are usually ___.','[]','temporary','这种药物可能有一些副作用，但通常是（暂时的）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(323,323,'She has an ___ ability to understand complex philosophical concepts.','[]','extraordinary','她有一种（非凡的）能力来理解复杂的哲学概念。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(324,324,'The discovery was completely ___ and surprised all the scientists.','[]','unexpected','这个发现完全（出乎意料），令所有科学家感到惊讶。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(325,325,'The report ___ that pollution levels have increased by 30% this year.','[]','indicates','报告（表明）今年的污染水平上升了30%。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(326,326,'He was ___ of stealing confidential documents from the company.','[]','accused','他被（指控）从公司窃取机密文件。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(327,327,'The novel tells the story of a young woman ___ with her identity.','[]','struggling','这部小说讲述了一位年轻女子（挣扎于）自我认同的故事。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(328,328,'He delivered a ___ speech that inspired everyone in the audience.','[]','compelling','他发表了一场（令人信服的）演讲，激励了在场的每一个人。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(329,329,'The phenomenon described in the book is ___ to human behavior.','[]','peculiar','书中描述的现象是人类行为所（特有的）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(330,330,'His argument was not ___ by any concrete evidence.','[]','substantiated','他的论点没有被任何具体证据（证实）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(331,331,'The ___ distribution of resources is a major challenge for many nations.','[]','unequal','资源的（不平等）分配是许多国家面临的重大挑战。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(332,332,'The architect ___ a building that combines beauty with functionality.','[]','designed','建筑师（设计）了一座将美观与功能结合的建筑物。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(333,333,'The factory ___ over 1,000 cars every month.','[]','produces','这家工厂每月（生产）1000多辆汽车。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(334,334,'The museum ___ many valuable paintings from the 18th century.','[]','displays','博物馆（展示）了许多18世纪的珍贵画作。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(335,335,'He was ___ for his honesty and hard work by the manager.','[]','praised','他因诚实和勤奋受到了经理的（表扬）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(336,336,'The two companies decided to ___ to develop new technology.','[]','cooperate','两家公司决定（合作）开发新技术。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(337,337,'A good teacher should be able to ___ complex ideas simply.','[]','explain','好老师应该能够简单地（解释）复杂的概念。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(338,338,'She was so tired that she could ___ stay awake.','[]','hardly','她太累了，（几乎）无法保持清醒。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(339,339,'Her dream is to ___ a famous writer one day.','[]','become','她的梦想是有一天（成为）一名著名作家。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(340,340,'He has a good ___ of computers and software.','[]','knowledge','他对计算机和软件有很好的（了解）。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(341,341,'Parents should ___ their children to read more books.','[]','encourage','家长应该（鼓励）孩子多读书。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(342,342,'Regular exercise can ___ the risk of heart disease significantly.','[]','reduce','定期锻炼可以显著（降低）心脏病的风险。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(343,343,'He spent the whole weekend ___ for the final exam.','[]','preparing','他花了整个周末（准备）期末考试。','2026-06-22 22:06:10','2026-06-22 22:06:10'),(424,424,'If I ___ you, I would accept the offer immediately.','[\"A. am\", \"B. was\", \"C. be\", \"D. were\"]','D','虚拟语气：与现在事实相反，be动词用were||如果我是你，我会立刻接受这个提议。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(425,425,'The book ___ I borrowed from the library is very interesting.','[\"A. who\", \"B. which\", \"C. what\", \"D. when\"]','B','定语从句：先行词the book是物，用which引导||我从图书馆借的那本书非常有趣。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(426,426,'Not until he arrived ___ the truth of the matter.','[\"A. he knew\", \"B. he did know\", \"C. did he know\", \"D. knew he\"]','C','倒装句：Not until在句首，主句部分倒装||直到他到达，他才知道事情的真相。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(427,427,'She has been studying English ___ she was ten years old.','[\"A. for\", \"B. when\", \"C. since\", \"D. while\"]','C','现在完成进行时 + since + 过去时间点||她从十岁起就一直在学英语。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(428,428,'It was in the library ___ I met Professor Wang yesterday.','[\"A. where\", \"B. that\", \"C. which\", \"D. when\"]','B','强调句型: It is/was…that…||我昨天是在图书馆遇见了王教授。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(429,429,'By the time he arrives, we ___ for two hours.','[\"A. will wait\", \"B. waited\", \"C. have waited\", \"D. will have been waiting\"]','D','将来完成进行时: by the time + 现在时, 主句将来完成||等他到时，我们将已经等了两个小时。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(430,430,'The teacher, as well as the students, ___ excited about the trip.','[\"A. are\", \"B. is\", \"C. were\", \"D. have been\"]','B','主谓一致：as well as连接时与第一个名词一致(The teacher)||老师和学生们一样对这次旅行感到兴奋。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(431,431,'I wish I ___ harder when I was in college.','[\"A. studied\", \"B. would study\", \"C. had studied\", \"D. study\"]','C','wish+虚拟语气：与过去事实相反用过去完成时||我真希望大学时能更努力学习。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(432,432,'___ is known to all, the earth moves around the sun.','[\"A. It\", \"B. As\", \"C. That\", \"D. What\"]','B','as引导非限制性定语从句: 众所周知||众所周知，地球绕着太阳转。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(433,433,'He talked as if he ___ everything about the project.','[\"A. knows\", \"B. has known\", \"C. knew\", \"D. will know\"]','C','as if+虚拟语气：与现在事实相反用一般过去时||他说得好像他对这个项目了如指掌。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(434,434,'___ hard he tries, he never seems to satisfy his boss.','[\"A. Whatever\", \"B. Whoever\", \"C. Whenever\", \"D. However\"]','D','However + adj/adv + 主语 + 谓语 = 无论多么||无论他多么努力，似乎都无法让老板满意。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(435,435,'The house ___ roof was damaged in the storm has been repaired.','[\"A. which\", \"B. that\", \"C. whose\", \"D. its\"]','C','定语从句：whose表示所属关系||那栋屋顶在暴风雨中受损的房子已经修好了。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(436,436,'Only by working together ___ solve this difficult problem.','[\"A. we can\", \"B. we will\", \"C. can we\", \"D. will we\"]','C','Only+状语在句首，主句部分倒装||只有齐心协力，我们才能解决这个难题。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(437,437,'What she said suggested that she ___ unhappy with the result.','[\"A. be\", \"B. were\", \"C. is\", \"D. was\"]','D','suggest此处表暗示而非建议，不用虚拟语气||她的话暗示她对结果不满意。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(438,438,'The number of students who ___ cars ___ increasing rapidly.','[\"A. own ... is\", \"B. owns ... are\", \"C. own ... are\", \"D. owns ... is\"]','A','who指代students(复数)用own; The number of用单数is||拥有汽车的学生数量正在快速增长。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(439,439,'Had I known the result earlier, I ___ a different decision.','[\"A. would make\", \"B. would have made\", \"C. made\", \"D. have made\"]','B','虚拟语气省略if的倒装：Had I known = If I had known||如果我早知道结果，我会做出不同的决定。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:35:26'),(440,440,'He is the only one of the students who ___ passed the test.','[\"A. have\", \"B. has\", \"C. had\", \"D. having\"]','B','the only one of + 复数名词 + who + 单数谓语||那些学生中只有他通过了考试。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(441,441,'___ we have finished the course, we shall start revision.','[\"A. Now that\", \"B. So that\", \"C. In that\", \"D. Except that\"]','A','Now that = 既然。引导原因状语从句||既然我们已完成课程，我们将开始复习。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(442,442,'There is no point ___ about the past; we should focus on the future.','[\"A. to complain\", \"B. complaining\", \"C. in complaining\", \"D. complain\"]','C','There is no point in doing sth = 做某事没有意义||纠结过去没有意义，我们应该关注未来。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(443,443,'It is high time that we ___ actions to protect the environment.','[\"A. take\", \"B. have taken\", \"C. will take\", \"D. took\"]','D','It is high time that + 过去时(虚拟语气)||我们早该采取行动保护环境了。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(444,444,'The committee recommended that measures ___ taken to address the issue.','[\"A. are\", \"B. be\", \"C. were\", \"D. should\"]','B','recommend that + (should) + 动词原形，虚拟语气||委员会建议采取措施解决问题。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(445,445,'Had I known about the meeting, I ___ attended.','[\"A. would have\", \"B. would\", \"C. will have\", \"D. should have\"]','A','虚拟语气省略if倒装: Had I known = If I had known，主句would have done||要是我知道那个会议，我就参加了。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(446,446,'It is imperative that every student ___ a foreign language.','[\"A. learns\", \"B. learn\", \"C. learned\", \"D. should learn\"]','B','It is imperative that + 主语 + (should) + 动词原形||每个学生都必须学习一门外语。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(447,447,'The professor suggested that he ___ harder.','[\"A. studies\", \"B. study\", \"C. studied\", \"D. studying\"]','B','suggest表建议时，that从句用虚拟语气: (should) + 动词原形||教授建议他更加努力学习。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(448,448,'He speaks English as if he ___ a native speaker.','[\"A. is\", \"B. were\", \"C. was\", \"D. be\"]','B','as if引导方式状语从句，与现在事实相反用were||他说英语就像母语者一样。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(449,449,'Not until all the data had been analyzed ___ the conclusion.','[\"A. they reached\", \"B. did they reach\", \"C. they did reach\", \"D. reached they\"]','B','否定词置于句首，主句部分倒装||直到所有数据被分析后，他们才得出结论。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(450,450,'The more you practice, the ___ progress you will make.','[\"A. more\", \"B. most\", \"C. much\", \"D. many\"]','A','the + 比较级…，the + 比较级… = 越…越…||你练习越多，进步就越大。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(451,451,'___, we would have succeeded.','[\"A. Had we worked harder\", \"B. We had worked harder\", \"C. If we worked harder\", \"D. If we have worked harder\"]','A','虚拟语气省略if倒装: Had we worked = If we had worked||如果我们更努力，我们就成功了。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(452,452,'It was not until midnight ___ the problem was finally solved.','[\"A. when\", \"B. that\", \"C. which\", \"D. before\"]','B','强调句型: It is/was not until…that…||直到午夜，问题才终于被解决。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(453,453,'___ his inexperience, he performed remarkably well.','[\"A. Considered\", \"B. Considering\", \"C. Being considered\", \"D. To consider\"]','B','considering (that) = 考虑到/鉴于，引导状语从句||考虑到他缺乏经验，他表现得异常出色。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(454,454,'He insisted that the meeting ___ postponed until next week.','[\"A. will be\", \"B. is\", \"C. be\", \"D. was\"]','C','insist表坚决要求时，that从句用虚拟语气: (should) + 动词原形||他坚持会议推迟到下周。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(455,455,'It is essential that everyone ___ on time for the meeting.','[\"A. arrives\", \"B. arrive\", \"C. arrived\", \"D. will arrive\"]','B','It is essential that + 主语 + (should) + 动词原形||每个人都必须准时参加会议。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(456,456,'Were it not for your help, I ___ the exam.','[\"A. could not pass\", \"B. could not have passed\", \"C. can not pass\", \"D. did not pass\"]','B','虚拟语气省略if倒装: Were it not = If it were not||要不是你的帮助，我考试就过不了了。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(457,457,'He looks as though he ___ a ghost.','[\"A. saw\", \"B. has seen\", \"C. had seen\", \"D. sees\"]','C','as though + 虚拟语气：与过去事实相反用过去完成时||他看起来好像见了鬼一样。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(458,458,'My suggestion is that she ___ more time on pronunciation.','[\"A. spends\", \"B. spend\", \"C. spent\", \"D. should spends\"]','B','表建议的名词性从句用虚拟语气: (should) + 动词原形||我建议她多花时间在发音上。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(459,459,'___ much advice you give him, he does exactly what he wants.','[\"A. Whatever\", \"B. No matter\", \"C. However\", \"D. Although\"]','C','However + much + 名词 + 主语 + 谓语 = 无论多少||无论你给他多少建议，他都我行我素。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(460,460,'They climbed higher ___ they might get a better view.','[\"A. in order\", \"B. so that\", \"C. because\", \"D. unless\"]','B','so that = 以便/为了，引导目的状语从句||他们爬得更高以便获得更好的视野。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(461,461,'Nowhere else in the world ___ such a beautiful sunset.','[\"A. you can find\", \"B. you will find\", \"C. can you find\", \"D. you have found\"]','C','否定词Nowhere在句首，部分倒装||世界上别处找不到这么美的日落。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(462,462,'He talks about Rome as if he ___ there himself.','[\"A. has been\", \"B. was\", \"C. had been\", \"D. went\"]','C','as if + 虚拟语气：与过去事实相反用过去完成时||他谈论罗马就好像亲自去过一样。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(463,463,'It is strange that she ___ nothing about the accident.','[\"A. knew\", \"B. knows\", \"C. should know\", \"D. has known\"]','C','It is strange that + should + 动词原形 表惊讶||真奇怪她竟然对事故一无所知。','2026-06-24 11:00:45','2026-06-24 11:36:07'),(464,464,'What is the man looking for?','[\"A. A subway station\", \"B. A bus stop\", \"C. A coffee shop\", \"D. A bookstore\"]','A. A subway station','对话中男士询问最近的地铁站在哪里，因此他正在寻找地铁站。','2026-10-31 18:53:24','2026-10-31 18:53:24'),(465,465,'Why did the woman miss the meeting?','[\"A. She was ill.\", \"B. She forgot the time.\", \"C. Her train was delayed.\", \"D. She had a family emergency.\"]','C. Her train was delayed.','女士提到列车因大雪晚点近一个小时，所以她错过了会议。','2026-10-31 18:53:24','2026-10-31 18:53:24'),(466,466,'What does the speaker suggest about online learning?','[\"A. It should replace traditional classrooms.\", \"B. It works best when combined with face-to-face teaching.\", \"C. It is unsuitable for college students.\", \"D. It requires less self-discipline.\"]','B. It works best when combined with face-to-face teaching.','讲话者认为线上学习提供灵活性，但与线下教学结合时效果最好。','2026-10-31 18:53:24','2026-10-31 18:53:24'),(467,467,'What is the main reason for the decline in bee populations according to the passage?','[\"A. Climate change alone.\", \"B. The use of pesticides and loss of habitat.\", \"C. An increase in natural predators.\", \"D. A shortage of honey.\"]','B. The use of pesticides and loss of habitat.','短文指出农药的广泛使用和自然栖息地的丧失是蜜蜂数量下降的两个主要原因。','2026-10-31 18:53:24','2026-10-31 18:53:24');
